= Jefferson Davis on Trial

The day of Jefferson Davis' treason trial has arrived. 

- @verdict: We can only hope the court rules correctly...

@verdict
on-arrival: radical_strength += 1; radical_dissent -= 2; moderate_strength -= 1; conservative_strength -= 2; conservative_dissent += 2; kkk_strength += 5; kkk_militancy += 0.1;

Congress votes to put Davis on trial. <span style="color: #7A1F5C;">**Radicals**</span> celebrate a stand for the Republic, while <span style="color: #9D2933;">**Moderates**</span> and <span style="color: #B5651D;">**Conservatives**</span> warn of the dangers: Southern resentment may explode, and a hostile court could even declare secession legal, threatening the legitimacy of Reconstruction.

